# There is nothing you need to put here to run the app.
#
# The map needs no API key: tiles come from OpenFreeMap and place search from
# Photon, both keyless and open.
#
# Your travel data lives in a Google Sheet, reached through an Apps Script web
# app. Neither the address of that web app nor its access code belongs in this
# file — a static site has no server to read environment variables on, and this
# repository is public, so anything here ships to every visitor. Both are typed
# into each browser once and kept in its own localStorage.
#
# See docs/SHEET-SETUP.md.
